    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43673" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδίοδ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to go through,
				permeable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					1.7.1
				</span></i>
			; <i>permeable</i> by the breezes, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕξις τῆς σαρκός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					887b24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>easily passing through</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοὺς πόρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Od.</u>
					60
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					2.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
